{
  "name": "ShopSnap CM - Nouvelle Vente -> MAJ Stock -> Rappel WhatsApp",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "airtable:TriggerWatchRecords",
      "version": 3,
      "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 }, "restore": {} },
      "parameters": {
        "__IMPORTDATA_connection": "YOUR_AIRTABLE_CONNECTION",
        "base": "YOUR_AIRTABLE_BASE_ID",
        "table": "Ventes",
        "view": null,
        "watchField": "Date_Vente"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "airtable:ActionGetRecord",
      "version": 3,
      "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0 }, "restore": {} },
      "parameters": {
        "__IMPORTDATA_connection": "YOUR_AIRTABLE_CONNECTION",
        "base": "YOUR_AIRTABLE_BASE_ID",
        "table": "Produits",
        "id": "{{1.Produit}}"
      },
      "comment": "Recupere le Stock_Actuel courant du produit vendu"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "airtable:ActionUpdateRecord",
      "version": 3,
      "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 0 }, "restore": {} },
      "parameters": {
        "__IMPORTDATA_connection": "YOUR_AIRTABLE_CONNECTION",
        "base": "YOUR_AIRTABLE_BASE_ID",
        "table": "Produits",
        "id": "{{1.Produit}}",
        "fields": {
          "Stock_Actuel": "{{2.Stock_Actuel - 1.Quantite}}"
        }
      },
      "comment": "Decremente le stock du montant vendu"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "module": "builtin:BasicFeatureIterator",
      "version": 1,
      "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 0 }, "restore": {} },
      "filter": {
        "name": "Uniquement les ventes a credit",
        "conditions": [
          [
            { "a": "{{1.Mode_Paiement}}", "o": "text:equal", "b": "credit" }
          ]
        ]
      },
      "comment": "Filtre Make (pas un module a proprement parler, place entre 3 et 5 dans le builder)"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "module": "airtable:ActionGetRecord",
      "version": 3,
      "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 0 }, "restore": {} },
      "parameters": {
        "__IMPORTDATA_connection": "YOUR_AIRTABLE_CONNECTION",
        "base": "YOUR_AIRTABLE_BASE_ID",
        "table": "Clients",
        "id": "{{1.Client}}"
      },
      "comment": "Recupere Nom_Client, WhatsApp, Langue_Preferee, Solde_Du_FCFA"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "module": "builtin:Router",
      "version": 1,
      "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": 0 }, "restore": {} },
      "routes": [
        {
          "id": "route_fr",
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 7,
              "module": "http:ActionSendData",
              "version": 3,
              "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": -150 }, "restore": {} },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Client francophone",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    { "a": "{{5.Langue_Preferee}}", "o": "text:equal", "b": "Français" }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              "parameters": {
                "url": "https://live-mt-server.wati.io/api/v1/sendTemplateMessage",
                "method": "POST",
                "headers": [
                  { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer YOUR_WATI_API_KEY" },
                  { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "qs": [ { "name": "whatsappNumber", "value": "{{5.WhatsApp}}" } ],
                "bodyType": "raw",
                "parseResponse": true,
                "data": "{\"template_name\":\"rappel_credit_fr\",\"broadcast_name\":\"rappel_credit_fr\",\"parameters\":[{\"name\":\"nom_client\",\"value\":\"{{5.Nom_Client}}\"},{\"name\":\"montant_du\",\"value\":\"{{5.Solde_Du_FCFA}}\"}]}"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "route_en",
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 8,
              "module": "http:ActionSendData",
              "version": 3,
              "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": 150 }, "restore": {} },
              "filter": {
                "name": "English speaking client",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    { "a": "{{5.Langue_Preferee}}", "o": "text:equal", "b": "English" }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              "parameters": {
                "url": "https://live-mt-server.wati.io/api/v1/sendTemplateMessage",
                "method": "POST",
                "headers": [
                  { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer YOUR_WATI_API_KEY" },
                  { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "qs": [ { "name": "whatsappNumber", "value": "{{5.WhatsApp}}" } ],
                "bodyType": "raw",
                "parseResponse": true,
                "data": "{\"template_name\":\"credit_reminder_en\",\"broadcast_name\":\"credit_reminder_en\",\"parameters\":[{\"name\":\"client_name\",\"value\":\"{{5.Nom_Client}}\"},{\"name\":\"amount_due\",\"value\":\"{{5.Solde_Du_FCFA}}\"}]}"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": false,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
    "designer": { "orphans": [] },
    "zone": "eu2.make.com",
    "notes": [
      "Ce blueprint est un GABARIT structurel, pas un export verifie a l'identique depuis un compte Make reel.",
      "A l'import (Scenarios > Create a new scenario > Import Blueprint), Make demandera de reconnecter chaque module Airtable et HTTP a vos propres comptes/API keys - c'est normal, les identifiants de connexion ne sont jamais exportables.",
      "Remplacer YOUR_AIRTABLE_BASE_ID, YOUR_AIRTABLE_CONNECTION et YOUR_WATI_API_KEY avant import.",
      "Les templates WATI 'rappel_credit_fr' et 'credit_reminder_en' doivent d'abord etre crees et approuves par Meta dans le tableau de bord WATI (Templates > Create Template), avec les variables {{1}} et {{2}} dans cet ordre.",
      "Le filtre du module 4 (credit uniquement) et les filtres des routes 7/8 (langue) se recreent en cliquant sur l'icone entonnoir entre deux modules dans l'editeur Make - ils ne sont pas des modules independants."
    ]
  }
}
